--- a/HISTORY.rst
+++ b/HISTORY.rst
@@ -3,6 +3,15 @@
 History
 -------
 
+Unreleased
+++++++++++
+
+- Add ``every().weekday`` to run a job Monday to Friday only, e.g.
+  ``schedule.every().weekday.at("09:00").do(job)``. With a timezone, the
+  weekday is judged in that timezone. An overdue weekday job is skipped
+  rather than run on a Saturday or Sunday.
+
+
 1.2.2 (2024-05-25)
 ++++++++++++++++++
 
